      "text": "Lehi1 sees strait and narrow path leading to tree, 1 Ne. 8:20. children shall say, The place is too strait for me, 1 Ne. 21:20 (Isa. 49:20). Christ’s example shows men straitness of path, 2 Ne. 31:9. strait and narrow path leads to eternal life, 2 Ne. 31:18–19. walk in strait path, 2 Ne. 33:9. enter in at strait gate, Jacob 6:11 (3 Ne. 14:13–14; 27:33; Matt. 7:13–14). word of God leads in strait and narrow course across gulf of misery, Hel. 3:29.",
